lier.  If Morphling's agility is 50% higher than strength, the maximum agility multiplier is used.\n\nKnockback distance and stun duration are based on Morphling's strength. If his strength is 50% higher than his agility, the maximum knockback distance and stun duration is used.", "notes_zh": ["弹道移动速度为%projectile_speed%。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_base", "damage_min", "damage_max", "stun_min", "stun_max", "knockback_min", "knockback_max", "knockback_duration", "projectile_speed", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "morphling_replicate", "name_zh": "变体精灵·变形", "name_en": "Morph", "description_zh": "使自身向敌方目标改变，获得其基础技能，并且基于目标改变自己的主属性。技能持续时间内可以来回切换。", "description_en": "Morphling changes his form to match the targeted enemy, gaining their basic abilities and changing his primary attribute based on his target. Can be toggled for the duration of the ability.", "notes_zh": ["变体精灵自身及其控制的单位不能作为变形的目标。", "变形不会复制魔晶/神杖类技能，除非变体精灵自身也拥有相应物品。", "不会触发法术反弹。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "变形增加多样施法（右键点击技能栏图标）。开启后会产生目标英雄的强幻象，可以施放英雄的所有基础技能。如果变体精灵切换变形时幻象还存活，他就会摧毁该幻象，并取而代之。", "en": "Adds an alt-cast to Morph. When enabled, a strong illusion is created of the target hero that can cast all of the hero's basic abilities. If the illusion is alive when Morphling toggles the ability, he will take the place of the illusion, destroying it."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "scepter_stat_steal", "scepter_spell_amplify", "scepter_attack_speed", "scepter_status_resist", "scepter_additional_stats", "scepter_illusion_outgoing", "scepter_illusion_incoming", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "phantom_lancer_spirit_lance", "name_zh": "幻影长矛手·灵魂之矛", "name_en": "Spirit Lance", "description_zh": "对敌方目标单位投出一支有魔力的灵魂之矛，造成伤害并减速，同时召唤一个幻象攻击该单位。", "description_en": "Sends a magical spirit lance to a target enemy unit that damages and slows, while summoning an illusory phantom to attack the unit.", "notes_zh": ["幻影长矛手附近%fake_lance_distance%范围内的幻象也会模仿施法动作。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["lance_damage", "lance_speed", "duration", "movement_speed_pct", "illusion_duration", "illusion_damage_out_pct", "tooltip_illusion_damage", "illusion_damage_in_pct", "tooltip_illusion_total_damage_in_pct", "fake_lance_distance", "scepter_bounce_radius", "scepter_bonus_illusion_damage", "scepter_total_hits", "illusion_lance_damage_pct", "AbilityCastRange"]}, {"subject": "pudge_dismember", "name_zh": "帕吉·肢解", "name_en": "Dismember", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 帕吉撕咬一个敌方单位，使其失去行动能力并受到持续伤害。伤害量为基础伤害加上帕吉力量值的一定百分比，帕吉将回复与伤害量相等的生命。帕吉会将该单位以每秒%pull_units_per_second%的速度向自身牵引，最多牵引%pull_distance_limit%距离。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - Pudge chows down on an enemy unit, disabling it and dealing damage over time. Damage is increased by Pudge's Strength and heals him for the total amount. Pudge pulls the unit at a rate of %pull_units_per_second% units, up to a minimum of %pull_distance_limit% range.", "notes_zh": ["即使肢解的目标在受到作用的过程中隐身，还是不会脱离肢解的作用。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["dismember_damage", "strength_damage", "ticks", "pull_units_per_second", "pull_distance_limit", "animation_rate", "shard_regen_pct", "order_lock_duration", "shard_cast_range", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityChannelTime", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "razor_static_link", "name_zh": "雷泽·静电连接", "name_en": "Static Link", "description_zh": "在雷泽和敌方英雄之间创造静电连接，偷取目标的攻击力并转移给雷泽。雷泽在连接生效时可以边移动边攻击。", "description_en": "Creates a charged link between Razor and an enemy Hero, stealing damage from the target and giving it to Razor. Allows Razor to attack while moving with the link active.", "notes_zh": ["链接在一方单位死亡或双方距离超过%drain_range_buffer%后断裂。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["drain_length", "drain_duration", "drain_rate", "drain_range_buffer", "radius", "speed", "vision_duration", "attack_speed_factor", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "storm_spirit_electric_vortex", "name_zh": "风暴之灵·电子涡流", "name_en": "Electric Vortex", "description_zh": "将一个敌人拖到风暴之灵所在位置的涡流。", "description_en": "A vortex that pulls an enemy unit to Storm Spirit's location.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "电子涡流变成范围型技能，可以作用于风暴之灵周围所有敌人。", "en": "Electric Vortex affects all enemies within a radius around Storm Spirit."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["electric_vortex_pull_distance", "electric_vortex_pull_tether_range", "electric_vortex_self_slow", "electric_vortex_self_slow_duration", "radius_scepter", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "sven_storm_bolt", "name_zh": "斯温·风暴之拳", "name_en": "Storm Hammer", "description_zh": "斯温用他充满魔力的手套对目标周围内所有敌人造成伤害和眩晕。", "description_en": "Sven unleashes his magical gauntlet that deals damage and stuns enemy units in a small area around the target.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提升施法距离，并且对目标施加弱驱散效果。可以影响无敌目标。设为多样施法（右键点击技能栏图标）后，额外造成%scepter_bonus_damage%点伤害并且斯温会跟随风暴之拳行进。", "en": "Increases cast range and applies a basic dispel on the target. Affects invulnerable units. If alt-cast, it deals an additional %scepter_bonus_damage% damage and Sven travels with the Storm Hammer."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["bolt_speed", "bolt_stun_duration", "bolt_aoe", "vision_radius", "scepter_bonus_damage", "bonus_damage_pct", "AbilityDamage", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "tiny_toss", "name_zh": "小小·投掷", "name_en": "Toss", "description_zh": "抓起小小身旁%grab_radius%范围内最近的单位，不论敌友，扔向目标单位或神符，落地时将造成伤害。", "description_en": "Grabs the nearest unit in a %grab_radius% radius around Tiny, ally or enemy, and launches it at the target unit or rune to deal damage where they land.", "notes_zh": ["你可以投掷队友，但他们不会受到伤害。", "投掷对建筑物造成33%的伤害。", "可以对减益免疫单位施放，但是不能将他们扔起，或对他们造成伤害。", "飞行时间是%duration%秒。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "grab_radius", "radius", "toss_damage", "toss_land_damage_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "tiny_toss_tree", "name_zh": "小小·扔树", "name_en": "Tree Throw", "description_zh": "将树木扔向目标单位，触发自身对其的攻击，并且对周围目标造成溅射伤害。", "description_en": "Throws the tree at the target unit, proccing your attack on it and splashing damage around the target.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["speed", "range", "bonus_damage", "splash_radius", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint"]}, {"subject": "vengefulspirit_magic_missile", "name_zh": "复仇之魂·魔法箭", "name_en": "Magic Missile", "description_zh": "向一个敌方单位射出魔法箭，眩晕并造成伤害。", "description_en": "Fires a magic missile at an enemy unit, stunning and dealing damage.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "可以对敌人弹射一次，以英雄优先，弹射距离为主目标的%bounce_range_pct%%%魔法箭施法距离内。", "en": "Bounces once on an enemy, prioritizing heroes, within %bounce_range_pct%%% of Magic Missile's current cast range from the first target."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["magic_missile_speed", "magic_missile_stun", "magic_missile_damage", "bounce_range_pct", "damage_per_lasthit", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "vengefulspirit_nether_swap", "name_zh": "复仇之魂·移形换位", "name_en": "Nether Swap", "description_zh": "与一个目标英雄瞬间交换位置，不论敌我。移形换位会打断目标的持续施法。敌方英雄被交换后受到伤害。复仇之魂和被交换的友方英雄都会获得等同于造成伤害的护盾。", "description_en": "Instantaneously swaps positions with a target Hero, friend or enemy. Nether Swap interrupts channeling abilities on the target. Enemy Swapped units take damage. Vengeful Spirit and allied swapped units gain a barrier e